<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>NPR 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.npr.org/1001/rss.xml</link><description>NPR 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:20:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>法国电影明星杰拉尔·德帕迪约因强奸和性侵犯被判受审</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6055559/gerard-depardieu-trial-rape-france</link><description>由于“#MeToo”运动在法国面临阻力，尤其是在艺术领域，该案件已成为法国处理性暴力问题中最突出的案件之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6055559/gerard-depardieu-trial-rape-france'&gt;法国电影明星杰拉尔·德帕迪约因强奸和性侵犯被判受审&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：French cinema star Gérard Depardieu ordered to stand trial for rape and sexual assault&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6055559/gerard-depardieu-trial-rape-france</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:49:50 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>感恩节风暴袭击东海岸。并且，黑色星期五销售额创下历史新高</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/g-s1-156004/up-first-newsletter-thanksgiving-storm-black-friday-shopping-asylum-supreme-court</link><description>一场强大的风暴导致近 100 万顾客断电，街道被淹。而且，专家预测通货膨胀不会抑制美国人的假期支出&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/g-s1-156004/up-first-newsletter-thanksgiving-storm-black-friday-shopping-asylum-supreme-court'&gt;感恩节风暴袭击东海岸。并且，黑色星期五销售额创下历史新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Thanksgiving storm batters East Coast. And, Black Friday sales to hit record levels&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/g-s1-156004/up-first-newsletter-thanksgiving-storm-black-friday-shopping-asylum-supreme-court</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:59:02 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>苏丹迷失的一代：战争正在夺走数百万人的童年</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6053049/sudans-lost-generation-war-is-stealing-a-generation-of-childhood</link><description>三年的战争夺走了苏丹数百万儿童的童年，使他们流离失所、挨饿、为生存而战，而不是在教室里学习。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6053049/sudans-lost-generation-war-is-stealing-a-generation-of-childhood'&gt;苏丹迷失的一代：战争正在夺走数百万人的童年&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Sudan's lost generation: War is stealing the childhood of millions&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6053049/sudans-lost-generation-war-is-stealing-a-generation-of-childhood</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:54:53 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>新一波民主党总检察长可能重塑司法系统</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/28/g-s1-155837/democratic-attorneys-general-justice-system-texas</link><description>民主党的胜利可能会对美国各地涉嫌犯罪的调查、提起的诉讼和审理的法庭案件产生重大影响。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/28/g-s1-155837/democratic-attorneys-general-justice-system-texas'&gt;新一波民主党总检察长可能重塑司法系统&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：New wave of Democratic attorneys general may reshape the justice system&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/28/g-s1-155837/democratic-attorneys-general-justice-system-texas</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 05:00:00 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>阿富汗东部一所学校发生爆炸，造成7人死亡、90多人受伤</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/28/nx-s1-6056284/explosion-school-eastern-afghanistan</link><description>当地官员表示，爆炸似乎起源于附近的一个采矿炸药库。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/28/nx-s1-6056284/explosion-school-eastern-afghanistan'&gt;阿富汗东部一所学校发生爆炸，造成7人死亡、90多人受伤&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Explosion at a school in eastern Afghanistan kills 7, wounds more than 90&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/28/nx-s1-6056284/explosion-school-eastern-afghanistan</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:32:37 -0500</pubDate></item></channel></rss>